	)
	(text "U1 uses the stock VL53L1 symbol/footprint: VL53L4ED is the same 12-pin optical LGA (4.4 x 2.4 mm)\nand is pin-compatible with VL53L1X / VL53L4CD. AVDD range 2.6 - 3.5 V. DNC (pin 8) left open.\nXSHUT and GPIO1 are pulled up to the filtered sensor rail (inputs are not 5 V tolerant)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
